        "Results get looked at once a quarter, after the damage is done. Trends and problems surface when it's too late to change anything.",
    },
    solution: {
      title: "Analyze Data on Every Cadence",
      description:
        "Daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly, and annual analysis, retrospective and predictive, that increases visibility and improves decision making.",
    },
  },
  {
    icon: `<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m21 7.5-9-5.25L3 7.5m18 0-9 5.25m9-5.25v9l-9 5.25M3 7.5l9 5.25M3 7.5v9l9 5.25m0-9v9" />`,
    problem: {
      title: "Letting Customer Interest Die in Decks",
